## Compare microscopes with an assistant

You can use ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, or another assistant to compare AIC microscopes using the facility inventory below. Attach the inventory to the conversation so the comparison stays grounded in the hardware and instrument status recorded by AIC.

!!! note "Planning aid"
    Use the assistant to narrow the options, then discuss the shortlist with AIC staff. Staff can help with sample compatibility, access, training, and configuration details that are not captured in the inventory.

### 1. Download the facility inventory

[Download the facility inventory (JSON)]({{ llm_inventory_asset_url }}){: download="llm_inventory.json" .md-button .md-button--primary style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;" }

### 2. Describe the experiment

Fill in the box below. Include the sample, fluorophores, live/fixed state, imaging depth, speed, duration, and any resolution or phototoxicity constraints that matter.

